cmp-015	F15: `... UNION ... ORDER BY a COLLATE NOCASE`
dt-017	F11: no date range limit; `date('9999-12-31','+1 day')` is `10000-01-01` where SQLite is NULL
dt-018	F12: hour 24 is normalised into the next day
